  "final_answer": "Here are hotels in **Mexico** with active deals for **Fri, Dec 25 – Sat, Dec 26, 2026** (1 night, 2 adults, 1 room), taken from Booking.com's deal-filtered results for Cancún, Quintana Roo — 437 properties matched the deal filter. Note: Booking.com's country-wide \"Mexico\" search kept redirecting me into city-level results, so the deal-flagged list below is for Cancún; I could not confirm a single all-Mexico deal list on this site.\n\n**Deal-badged picks**\n- **Secrets Playa Blanca Costa Mujeres – All Inclusive Adults Only** — Costa Mujeres, beachfront, scored 9.2 \"Wonderful\" (447 reviews), value-for-money 9.1. *Late Escape Deal*, Junior Suite Tropical View King, all-inclusive, free cancellation, price includes taxes and fees.\n- **Hyatt Vivid Cancun – Adults Only All Inclusive** — Hotel Zone, beachfront, scored 8.4 \"Very Good\" (234 reviews). *Late Escape Deal*, Deluxe Ocean View Double, all-inclusive, free cancellation, taxes and fees included.\n- **Casa Jicama** — Downtown Cancun, 200 m from downtown, scored 8.7 \"Excellent\" (198 reviews). *Limited-time Deal*, King Studio, 35 m², 1 queen bed, +US$29 taxes and fees.\n- **Hotel Plaza Caribe** — Downtown Cancun, 0.8 km from downtown, scored 7.4 \"Good\" (1,151 reviews). *Limited-time Deal*, Superior Double Room (2 full beds), free cancellation, no prepayment needed, +US$13 taxes and fees.\n- **BOK21 – Hotel en Cancun** — Downtown Cancun, scored 8.0 \"Very Good\" (1,860 reviews). *Late Escape Deal*, Deluxe Room, 1 queen bed, free cancellation, +US$10 taxes and fees.\n\n**Other good value (no deal badge)**\n- **Fairfield by Marriott Inn & Suites Cancun Downtown** — 8.6 \"Excellent\" (702 reviews), Double Queen Room with breakfast, US$83 + US$22 taxes and fees.\n- **Adhara Hacienda Cancun** — 8.6 \"Excellent\" (4,110 reviews), Standard Double Room with breakfast, US$90 + US$19 taxes and fees.\n- **Ibis Cancun Centro** — 8.2 \"Very Good\" (1,734 reviews), Standard Double with two single beds, US$58 + US$17 taxes and fees.\n- **City Express by Marriott Cancun Aeropuerto** — 7.9 \"Good\" (6,221 reviews), Standard Queen Room with breakfast, free cancellation, no prepayment, US$104 + US$27 taxes and fees.\n\nMy pick: **Secrets Playa Blanca Costa Mujeres** for a beachfront all-inclusive under a Late Escape Deal with the highest guest score (9.2); **Casa Jicama** or **Hotel Plaza Caribe** if you want downtown and free cancellation. Tell me a different region (Mexico City, Los Cabos, Puerto Vallarta, Riviera Maya) and I'll pull the deal-filtered list for those dates.",
